      "extract": "*What can we say about the representations of the symmetric groups $\\mathfrak{S}(n)$ in the limit $n\\to\\infty$?* This very general question is the subject of investigations of *the asymptotic representation theory of the symmetric groups*. Even though for almost any question of the representation theory of the symmetric groups the answer is known, usually this answer is given by a combinatorial algorithm (for",
